73"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":26.74,"default_fair_val":26.74,"premium_pct":330.5,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":81.9,"pe_forward":72.1,"pb_trailing":5,"pb_forward":4.5,"div_yield":2.91,"ps_ratio":6.6,"fcf_to_ev":4.76,"fcf_to_mcap":3.8,"liab_to_assets":104.1,"cash_to_assets":0.9,"current_ratio":0.73,"roe":18,"roa":1.9,"moat":{"ticker":"IRM","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"Iron Mountain 在文件儲存和資訊管理領域擁有穩固的品牌聲譽，這使其在一定程度上具備了定價權。客戶依賴其安全、可靠的服務來保護關鍵數據，這種信任感是難以被競爭對手輕易複製的。然而，其服務本質上仍有一定程度的商品化，尤其是在標準化的數據儲存服務方面，這限制了其極高的品牌溢價能力。相較於奢侈品牌或必需消費品，其品牌影響力在定價決策中的作用相對較弱，因此評分為中等。","comment_en":"Iron Mountain possesses a solid brand reputation in document storage and information management, granting it a degree of pricing power. Clients rely on its secure and dependable services to protect critical data, a trust that is not easily replicated by competitors. However, the nature of its services still has a degree of commoditization, particularly in standardized data storage, which limits its ability to command extremely high brand premiums. Compared to luxury brands or essential consumer goods, its brand influence plays a relatively weaker role in pricing decisions, hence the moderate score."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"Iron Mountain 的業務模式主要依賴於物理儲存設施、物流網絡和資訊管理服務，而非依賴專利或特許經營權。雖然其在某些特定技術或流程上可能擁有專利，但這些並非其核心競爭力的主要來源，也不構成顯著的進入壁壘。行業監管主要集中在數據隱私和安全標準，但這些標準對所有參與者都是公開的，並未給予 Iron Mountain 獨特的監管優勢。因此，在專利和監管壁壘方面，其得分較低。","comment_en":"Iron Mountain's business model primarily relies on physical storage facilities, logistics networks, and information management services, rather than patents or regulatory licenses. While it may hold patents for certain specific technologies or processes, these are not the primary source of its core competitive advantage and do not constitute significant barriers to entry. Industry regulations mainly focus on data privacy and security standards, but these standards are public to all participants and do not grant Iron Mountain a unique regulatory advantage. Therefore, its score in terms of patents and regulatory barriers is low."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Iron Mountain 的服務具有顯著的轉換成本壁壘。一旦客戶將大量敏感文件或數據託付給 Iron Mountain 進行儲存和管理，遷移到另一家服務提供商將涉及巨大的時間、金錢和潛在風險成本。這包括數據恢復、重新索引、員工培訓以及確保服務連續性的複雜過程。這種高昂的轉換成本有效地鎖定了現有客戶群，並為公司提供了穩定的收入來源，體現了強大的經濟護城河。","comment_en":"Iron Mountain's services possess significant switching cost barriers. Once clients entrust large volumes of sensitive documents or data to Iron Mountain for storage and management, migrating to another service provider involves substantial costs in time, money, and potential risks. This includes complex processes like data retrieval, re-indexing, employee training, and ensuring service continuity. These high switching costs effectively lock in the existing customer base and provide the company with a stable revenue stream, demonstrating a strong economic moat."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"Iron Mountain 的業務模式並未顯著受益於網絡效應。其核心服務是為單一客戶提供獨立的儲存和管理解決方案，一個客戶的參與並不會直接增加其他客戶的價值。雖然公司擁有龐大的客戶基礎和廣泛的服務網絡，但這更多是規模優勢的體現，而非網絡效應的典型特徵。不同客戶之間的數據或服務並無直接的互動或增值，因此網絡效應在此幾乎不存在。","comment_en":"Iron Mountain's business model does not significantly benefit from network effects. Its core service involves providing independent storage and management solutions for individual clients; the participation of one client does not directly increase the value for other clients. While the company has a large customer base and an extensive service network, this is more a reflection of scale advantages rather than a typical characteristic of network effects. There is no direct interaction or value addition between data or services of different clients, thus network effects are virtually non-existent here."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"Iron Mountain 在文件儲存和管理行業中擁有巨大的規模經濟優勢。其龐大的全球網絡、先進的儲存設施和高效的物流系統，使得單位儲存和處理成本遠低於小型競爭對手。這種規模優勢不僅體現在成本控制上，也體現在其服務的廣度和深度上，能夠滿足各種規模客戶的需求。這種成本領先地位是其強大的護城河，讓新進入者難以匹敵。","comment_en":"Iron Mountain possesses significant economies of scale in the document storage and management industry. Its vast global network, advanced storage facilities, and efficient logistics systems result in unit storage and processing costs far lower than those of smaller competitors. This scale advantage is reflected not only in cost control but also in the breadth and depth of its services, capable of meeting the needs of clients of all sizes. This cost leadership position is a formidable moat, making it difficult for new entrants to compete."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Iron Mountain 擁有遍布全球的戰略性地理位置的儲存設施網絡，這構成了其獨特的資產壁壘。這些設施的選址考慮了安全性、可訪問性和成本效益，並且在許多關鍵市場建立了長期存在的據點。對於需要本地化儲存和快速響應的客戶而言，這種廣泛的地理覆蓋是重要的優勢。雖然地理位置本身並非絕對稀缺，但其網絡的規模和成熟度構成了顯著的進入障礙。","comment_en":"Iron Mountain's network of storage facilities in strategically located global positions constitutes its unique asset barrier. The selection of these facility locations considers security, accessibility, and cost-effectiveness, and it has established long-standing presences in many key markets. For clients requiring localized storage and rapid response, this extensive geographical coverage is a significant advantage. While geography itself is not absolutely scarce, the scale and maturity of its network form a considerable barrier to entry."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Iron Mountain 在營運效率方面表現出色，這得益於其長期積累的專業知識、標準化的流程以及對技術的持續投資。公司能夠高效地管理龐大的物理資產和複雜的物流，確保數據的安全性和及時訪問。其不斷優化的營運模式，包括自動化和數據分析的應用，進一步鞏固了其成本優勢和服務可靠性。這種卓越的營運能力是其核心競爭力之一。","comment_en":"Iron Mountain excels in operational efficiency, benefiting from its long-accumulated expertise, standardized processes, and continuous investment in technology. The company efficiently manages vast physical assets and complex logistics, ensuring data security and timely access. Its continuously optimized operational model, including the application of automation and data analytics, further solidifies its cost advantage and service reliability. This superior operational capability is one of its core competencies."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Iron Mountain 在資本配置方面展現出一定的戰略眼光，尤其是在通過收購擴張其服務範圍和地理覆蓋方面。公司在平衡債務負擔與股東回報之間努力尋求最佳點，並持續投資於技術升級和設施現代化以維持競爭力。雖然其財務結構（高負債）需要謹慎管理，但其在核心業務的有機增長和戰略性併購之間的權衡，顯示了管理層對資本配置的重視，為長期價值創造奠定了基礎。","comment_en":"Iron Mountain demonstrates a degree of strategic vision in capital allocation, particularly in expanding its service scope and geographical coverage through acquisitions. The company strives to find the optimal balance between managing its debt burden and shareholder returns, while continuously investing in technology upgrades and facility modernization to maintain competitiveness. Although its financial structure (high debt) requires careful management, its balancing act between organic growth in core businesses and strategic M&A highlights management's focus on capital allocation, laying the groundwork for long-term value creation."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"結合高轉換成本（M3）和卓越的營運效率（M7），Iron Mountain 實現了極高的客戶保留率。一旦客戶選擇了 Iron Mountain，由於遷移的複雜性和成本，他們通常會長期維持合作關係。公司通過提供可靠、安全且不斷進化的服務來滿足客戶不斷變化的需求，進一步鞏固了客戶忠誠度。這種穩定的客戶基礎是其持續收入和盈利能力的關鍵支柱。","comment_en":"Combined with high switching costs (M3) and excellent operational efficiency (M7), Iron Mountain achieves exceptionally high customer retention rates. Once clients choose Iron Mountain, due to the complexity and cost of migration, they typically maintain a long-term relationship. The company further solidifies customer loyalty by providing reliable, secure, and evolving services that meet clients' changing needs. This stable customer base is a key pillar of its sustained revenue and profitability."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Iron Mountain 的業務具有相當的持久性。文件儲存和資訊管理是企業運營中長期存在的剛性需求，尤其是在合規和記錄保存方面。儘管數位化趨勢帶來挑戰，但大量紙質文件和歷史記錄仍需安全儲存，且新興的數據儲存需求也在增長。其龐大的基礎設施和客戶基礎提供了穩定的現金流，使其能夠抵禦經濟週期的波動。只要企業需要管理和保存信息，Iron Mountain 的核心業務就具有持久的生命力。","comment_en":"Iron Mountain's business possesses considerable durability. Document storage and information management are long-standing, rigid needs in corporate operations, especially concerning compliance and record-keeping. Despite the challenges posed by digitalization trends, a vast amount of paper documents and historical records still require secure storage, and demand for new data storage is also growing. Its extensive infrastructure and customer base provide stable cash flows, enabling it to withstand economic cycle fluctuations. As long as businesses need to manage and preserve information, Iron Mountain's core business has enduring vitality."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Iron Mountain 的護城河主要建立在顯著的轉換成本、龐大的規模經濟和卓越的營運效率之上，使其在文件儲存和資訊管理領域形成了強大的競爭壁壘。其全球化的資產網絡和穩定的客戶關係進一步鞏固了其市場地位。雖然缺乏專利或網絡效應等壁壘，但其核心業務的持久性以及在成本和服務可靠性上的領先，使其具備了類似「收費橋」的特徵，能夠穩定地從客戶對信息管理的需求中獲利。管理層在資本配置上的努力，旨在維持和擴大這一優勢。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Iron Mountain's moat is primarily built upon significant switching costs, substantial economies of scale, and excellent operational efficiency, creating strong competitive barriers in the document storage and information management sector. Its global asset network and stable customer relationships further solidify its market position. While lacking barriers like patents or network effects, the durability of its core business and its leadership in cost and service reliability give it characteristics akin to a 'toll bridge,' enabling it to consistently profit from clients' information management needs. Management's efforts in capital allocation aim to maintain and expand this advantage.","evidenceHash":"ed36a14fa56e6c611e33e552579c7111546053ccb31635007176e71a580f7b46","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":4,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T15:49:45.331Z","evidenceHash":"fcf31fbd09abb05b23d71a84495ab9123aeca92dfa1d88cb0aa372d2585b4206"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T15:49:45.331Z","evidenceHash":"fcf31fbd09abb05b23d71a84495ab9123aeca92dfa1d88cb0aa372d2585b4206"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/IRM.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/IRM.png","website":"https://www.ironmountain.com","ceo":"William L. Meaney","full_time_employees":"29400","description":"Established in 1951, Iron Mountain Incorporated (NYSE: IRM) has become the world's foremost authority in storage and information management solutions. More than 225,000 organizations globally trust Iron Mountain with their critical assets. With an extensive physical infrastructure spanning over 90 million square feet, the company operates approximately 1,450 facilities in around 50 countries. Within this vast network, Iron Mountain safeguards billions of valued items, including vital corporate records, highly confidential digital assets, and invaluable cultural and historical artifacts. Their comprehensive suite of offerings encompasses secure document archiving, robust information governance, digital transformation initiatives, confidential destruction services, along with advanced data centers, cloud computing solutions, and specialized art storage and logistics. These services empower clients to mitigate costs and risks, ensure regulatory compliance, facilitate swift disaster recovery, and enable a more efficient, digital-first operational model.","description_en":"Established in 1951, Iron Mountain Incorporated (NYSE: IRM) has become the world's foremost authority in storage and information management solutions. More than 225,000 organizations globally trust Iron Mountain with their critical assets. With an extensive physical infrastructure spanning over 90 million square feet, the company operates approximately 1,450 facilities in around 50 countries. Within this vast network, Iron Mountain safeguards billions of valued items, including vital corporate records, highly confidential digital assets, and invaluable cultural and historical artifacts. Their comprehensive suite of offerings encompasses secure document archiving, robust information governance, digital transformation initiatives, confidential destruction services, along with advanced data centers, cloud computing solutions, and specialized art storage and logistics. These services empower clients to mitigate costs and risks, ensure regulatory compliance, facilitate swift disaster recovery, and enable a more efficient, digital-first operational model.","description_zh":"Iron Mountain Incorporated（美股代碼：IRM）為 Real Estate 領域之重要企業，專注於 REIT - Specialty 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"85 New Hampshire Avenue","city":"Portsmouth","state":"NH","zip":"03801","country":"US","phone":"617 535 4766","full_address":"85 New Hampshire Avenue, Portsmouth, NH 03801, US","range_52w":"77.77-134.68","year_high":134.68,"year_low":77.77,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":77.77,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-08","name":"Samuels Theodore R. II","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":310,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-05","name":"Simons Doyle","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":350,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-05","name":"Samuels Theodore R. II","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":104,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-1